answers.approach:
First gather real questions that buyers and experts say,
Then ask them across models and regions, day after day.

Record each brand and claim and link, and watch the answers flow;
Distrust a single ranking score—it hides what we don’t know.

Test one source change at a time and watch the model’s tune;
With holdouts and repeats, we won’t go promising the moon.

No pane reveals the hidden weights, no lever rules the stream;
We’ll map what sometimes moves the names, not claim we’ve solved the dream.
